WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:15.649
Danny: We have to get those guys!

2
00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:18.711
Brad: I agree with you, but what can we do?

3
00:00:18.712 --> 00:00:21.146
Danny: Your dad is a famous scientist.

4
00:00:21.147 --> 00:00:24.764
You must get some ideas from him.

5
00:00:24.765 --> 00:00:26.957
Brad: Well . . .

6
00:00:26.958 --> 00:00:29.412
Danny: Hee hee! I knew it!

7
00:00:29.413 --> 00:00:32.840
You have been working on something top secret.

8
00:00:32.841 --> 00:00:34.992
Danny: What is that?

9
00:00:34.993 --> 00:00:40.710
Brad: I don't like to brag, but . . .

10
00:00:40.711 --> 00:00:43.729
Brad: It's a paper-clip shooter!

11
00:00:43.730 --> 00:00:46.074
Danny: A paper-clip shooter?

12
00:00:46.075 --> 00:00:48.417
How is that going to help?

13
00:00:48.418 --> 00:00:54.517
Brad: Watch!

14
00:00:54.518 --> 00:00:56.191
Brad: Pretty cool, huh?

15
00:00:56.192 --> 00:01:00.152
Danny: That won't hurt a fly!

16
00:01:00.153 --> 00:01:02.436
Brad: It might sting if it hit you.

17
00:01:02.437 --> 00:01:04.948
Danny: We don't need to sting those bullies!

18
00:01:04.949 --> 00:01:07.112
We need to defeat them!

19
00:01:07.113 --> 00:01:09.939
Brad: What do you mean "defeat" them?

20
00:01:09.940 --> 00:01:14.425
Danny: I mean something like sending them far into space!

21
00:01:14.426 --> 00:01:15.862
Brad: How?

22
00:01:15.863 --> 00:01:19.393
Danny: We could create super special shoelaces.

23
00:01:19.394 --> 00:01:25.206
Danny: When Chuck and Dave tie their shoes, the knot changes [n3@the laces into rocket fuel.

24
00:01:25.207 --> 00:01:30.220
Danny: Blast! Those bullies shoot high into the air!

25
00:01:30.221 --> 00:01:32.364
Brad: That would be cool.

26
00:01:32.365 --> 00:01:39.528
Danny: Or . . . we could invent a special potion and pour it [n3@into their juice at lunchtime.

27
00:01:39.529 --> 00:01:44.762
Danny: It would make them burp every time they open their mouths.

28
00:01:44.763 --> 00:01:47.210
Brad: That would be awesome!

29
00:01:47.211 --> 00:01:52.218
Danny: Imagine how funny it would be when the teacher asked them a question.

30
00:01:52.219 --> 00:01:55.840
Brad: They would be too embarrassed to come to school!

31
00:01:55.841 --> 00:02:00.555
Danny: Or . . . what if we made a growth powder?

32
00:02:00.556 --> 00:02:03.495
Danny: We could put it into their shoes.

33
00:02:03.496 --> 00:02:07.331
Danny: Their feet would grow and grow and grow.

34
00:02:07.332 --> 00:02:19.365
Danny: Every time they took a step, they would trip [n3@because their feet were too big!

35
00:02:19.366 --> 00:02:24.210
Mom: Well, I'm glad to see you boys are having so much fun.

36
00:02:24.211 --> 00:02:26.180
Danny: Hi, Mrs. Joseph.

37
00:02:26.181 --> 00:02:30.690
Mom: Hello, Danny. I brought you some milk and cookies.

38
00:02:30.691 --> 00:02:34.966
Brad: We're thinking up evil plans, Mom.

39
00:02:34.967 --> 00:02:39.099
Mom: Oh, I'm sure you are being very wicked.

40
00:02:39.100 --> 00:02:41.493
Danny: No, no. Really. He means it!

41
00:02:41.494 --> 00:02:43.258
Mom: I believe you, Danny.

42
00:02:43.259 --> 00:02:47.967
Have fun, boys.

43
00:02:47.968 --> 00:02:50.823
Brad: I don't think she believed us.

44
00:02:50.824 --> 00:02:52.178
Danny: Why not?

45
00:02:52.179 --> 00:02:54.096
Brad: Because we're too nice.

46
00:02:54.097 --> 00:02:56.600
We're not big enough to be mean.

47
00:02:56.601 --> 00:03:00.742
Danny: We need to bring those bullies down to size!

48
00:03:00.743 --> 00:03:04.893
Brad: Down to size . . . Hmm.

49
00:03:04.894 --> 00:03:07.113
Danny: What are you thinking?

50
00:03:07.114 --> 00:03:13.140
Brad: Well . . . we could . . . I think we could shrink them.

51
00:03:13.141 --> 00:03:18.242
Danny: Shrink them? How?

52
00:03:18.243 --> 00:03:20.228
Brad: I found this the other day.

53
00:03:20.229 --> 00:03:26.277
It's from my dad's work.
